        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey guys and gals,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have recently been playing with &#39;The Sentinels&#39; and been playing &#39;Mainstay&#39;s&#39; block power as if it reduces damage to all heros. It says &quot;Reduce damage dealt to all your hero targets by 1 until the start of your next turn.&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, I then watched a video uploaded by the lonesome gamer, and he was playing it as if it affected only the Sentinels team, not ALL HEROES as it states on the card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyone care to tell me which is correct?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cheers :)</p>",
